{"title":"Stokes' Theorem","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Stokes' Theorem</b> is a theorem in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calculus\" title=\"Calculus\">calculus</a> regarding the relationship between surface integrals and line integrals.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Statement\">Statement</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stokes%27_Theorem&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Statement\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/94117127950171909690dd0b132030fb1632fe89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\int_{S} \\int \\text{curl F} \\cdot \\text{dS}=\\int_{C} \\text{F} \\cdot \\text{dr}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"209\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Proof\">Proof</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stokes%27_Theorem&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Proof\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stokes%27_Theorem&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Green%27s_Theorem\" title=\"Green&#39;s Theorem\">Green's Theorem</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Divergence_Theorem\" title=\"Divergence Theorem\">Divergence Theorem</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Stokes%27_Theorem&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018111222\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 249/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.801      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.801      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26680:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018111222 and revision id 210261. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}